  "description": "🏕️☕ Cozy Camping Collection\nEscape into the peaceful beauty of the outdoors with this collection of 20 cozy camping watercolor clipart illustrations. Inspired by quiet forest mornings, glowing campfires, warm mugs of cocoa, scenic mountain views, woodland adventures, and comfortable campsite moments, this bundle captures the relaxing side of camping in a soft modern watercolor style.\n🌲 Perfect for:\n– Stickers\n– Scrapbooking\n– Junk journals\n– Digital & physical planners\n– Greeting cards\n– Nature-themed crafts\n– Print on Demand products\n📦 What’s Included:\n– 20 PNG illustrations\n– 20 SVG files\n– Transparent background\n– High resolution\n– 300 DPI\n– Instant digital download\n🔥 Included illustrations: Campfire cocoa, Toasted marshmallow, Classic s’more, Cozy camping tent, Camp lantern, Adventure backpack, Morning camp breakfast, Hiking boots, Camping kettle over the fire ,Forest log seat with cocoa, Camping chair with blanket, Forest picnic basket, Cozy sleeping bag, Campfire skillet, Forest trail sign, Mountain sunrise landscape, Pine forest path, Lakeside evening landscape, Camp supply crate, Cozy campfire evening\n🍂Inspired by peaceful forest campsites, mountain sunrises, glowing campfires, steaming mugs of cocoa, quiet hiking trails, lakeside evenings, woodland picnics, and the simple joy of slowing down in nature. These illustrations blend cozy outdoor living with a fresh contemporary watercolor style, creating a warm and inviting camping collection.",
